---
import IllustrationFigure from "~/components/illustration-kit/IllustrationFigure.astro"
import SvgFigure from "~/components/illustration-kit/SvgFigure.astro"
import { series, stroke } from "~/data/palette"

const marks = [
  { x: 344 },
  { x: 185, time: "12:30", top: false },
  { x: 105.5, time: "12:15", top: true },
  { x: 65.75, time: "12:07:30", top: false },
  { x: 45.87, time: "12:03:45", top: true },
  { x: 35.93 },
  { x: 30.96 },
  { x: 28.47 },
  { x: 27.22 },
]
---

<IllustrationFigure
  name="grim-reaper"
  lead="There are reapers after noon, but no earliest one."
>
  <SvgFigure
    name="grim-reaper-timeline"
    class="mx-auto w-full max-w-lg"
    viewBox="0 0 390 166"
    title="An endless series of reaper times accumulating immediately after noon"
    desc="Time moves right from noon to 1pm. Reapers act at 1pm, 12:30pm, 12:15pm, 12:07:30pm and repeatedly halfway closer to noon. Many earlier times are marked near noon; every reaper time has another reaper time even closer to noon. There is no first reaper after noon."
  >
    <g fill="none" stroke={stroke} stroke-width="2">
      <path d="M26 96 H366 m-7 -5 7 5 -7 5" />
    </g>
    <g fill="currentColor" font-size="17">
      <text x="26" y="127" text-anchor="middle">
        Noon
      </text>
      <text x="344" y="127" text-anchor="middle">
        1pm
      </text>
      <text x="196" y="18" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700">
        Later →
      </text>
    </g>
    {marks.map(({ x, time, top }) => (
      <g>
        <path d={`M${x} 90 V102`} stroke={series.red} stroke-width="1.3" />
        <circle cx={x} cy="96" r="3" fill={series.red} />
        {!!time && (
          <text
            x={x}
            y={top ? 72 : 147}
            text-anchor="middle"
            fill="currentColor"
            font-size="16"
          >
            {time}
          </text>
        )}
      </g>
    ))}
    <g fill="none" stroke={stroke} stroke-width="2.5">
      <path d="M25.5 86 V106" />
    </g>
    <text x="26" y="49" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor" font-size="16">
      …
    </text>
  </SvgFigure>
  <Fragment slot="caption">
    If the man lives past noon, some reaper should kill him. Yet no reaper can be the first to
    do so: another is always scheduled earlier. The arrangement is inconsistent. Whether that
    rules out endless causal chains generally remains disputed.
  </Fragment>
</IllustrationFigure>
